@startuml
actor "Utente (Player/Admin)" as User
participant "Web App\n(React)" as WebApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Spring Cloud Gateway)" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service\n(Spring Boot)" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL\n(Auth DB)" as DB

User -> WebApp: Inserisce credenziali (email/password) o clicca "Login with Google"
WebApp -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/auth/login
Gateway -> Auth: Inoltra richiesta di Login

Auth -> DB: Verifica utente e hash password
alt Credenziali Valide
    DB --> Auth: User record
    Auth -> Auth: Genera Access Token (JWT) e Refresh Token
    Auth --> Gateway: 200 OK {accessToken, refreshToken}
    Gateway --> WebApp: 200 OK {accessToken, refreshToken}
    WebApp -> WebApp: Salva Token in localStorage / HttpOnly Cookie
    WebApp -> User: Mostra Dashboard autenticata
else Credenziali Invalide
    Auth --> Gateway: 401 Unauthorized
    Gateway --> WebApp: 401 Unauthorized
    WebApp -> User: Mostra errore credenziali
end

== Esempio di Chiamata Autenticata successiva ==
User -> WebApp: Richiede lista tornei
WebApp -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/tournaments\n(Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)
Gateway -> Gateway: Valida firma JWT e scadenza (Gateway Filter)
Gateway -> Gateway: Estrae Ruoli dal JWT
alt Token Valido e Autorizzato
    Gateway -> "Tournament Service": Inoltra GET /api/v1/tournaments (con Header User-Id)
    "Tournament Service" --> Gateway: 200 OK [lista tornei]
    Gateway --> WebApp: 200 OK [lista tornei]
    WebApp -> User: Mostra lista
else Token Invalido/Scaduto
    Gateway --> WebApp: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
end
@enduml
